## Interface: 16001, 16000, 120105, 120100, 120007
## Title: AbleCraft
## Notes: Accessibility suite for World of Warcraft (Text-to-Speech and accessibility tools).
## Notes-ptBR: Suíte de acessibilidade para World of Warcraft (Texto para Fala e ferramentas de acessibilidade).
## Notes-deDE: Barrierefreiheits-Suite für World of Warcraft (Text-zu-Sprache und Werkzeuge).
## Notes-frFR: Suite d'accessibilité pour World of Warcraft (Synthèse vocale et outils).
## Notes-esES: Suite de accesibilidad para World of Warcraft (Texto a voz y herramientas).
## Notes-esMX: Suite de accesibilidad para World of Warcraft (Texto a voz y herramientas).
## Notes-itIT: Suite di accessibilità per World of Warcraft (Sintesi vocale e strumenti).
## Notes-ruRU: Набор инструментов доступности для World of Warcraft (озвучивание текста и утилиты).
## Notes-koKR: 월드 오브 워크래프트 접근성 도구 모음 (텍스트 음성 변환 및 보조 기능).
## Notes-zhCN: 魔兽世界无障碍套件（文本转语音与辅助工具）。
## Notes-zhTW: 魔獸世界無障礙套件（文字轉語音與輔助工具）。
## Author: Michael O'Drake
## Version: 1.0.0
## X-Category: Accessibility
## SavedVariables: AbleCraftDB, UiTTSDB

# i18n: loader first, then per-locale files (each guards on GetLocale()).
Locales\Locales.lua
Locales\enUS.lua
Locales\ptBR.lua
Locales\deDE.lua
Locales\esES.lua
Locales\esMX.lua
Locales\frFR.lua
Locales\itIT.lua
Locales\koKR.lua
Locales\ruRU.lua
Locales\zhCN.lua
Locales\zhTW.lua

# Core: AbleCraft.lua sets up the root menu and DB; UiTTS.lua publishes UiTTS_NS helpers.
AbleCraft.lua
UiTTS.lua
UiTTS_UIReader.lua
UiTTS_XP.lua
UiTTS_Chat.lua
# Options must load before the Guide so the Guide can attach as a subcategory.
UiTTS_Options.lua
UiTTS_Guide.lua

# NOTE: Bindings.xml is intentionally NOT listed here. WoW auto-loads a file
# named Bindings.xml from the addon root; listing it in the .toc would also route
# it through the generic UI-XML parser, which raises "Unrecognized XML: Binding".
